{"title": "Armour of Agathys (passive feature)", "pageid": 51121, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Armour_of_Agathys_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Armour_of_Agathys_(passive_feature).webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Armour_of_Agathys_%28passive_feature%29.webp/300px-Armour_of_Agathys_%28passive_feature%29.webp, /w/images/4/48/Armour_of_Agathys_%28passive_feature%29.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Armour_of_Agathys_%28passive_feature%29.webp/300px-Armour_of_Agathys_%28passive_feature%29.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/Armour_of_Agathys_%28passive_feature%29.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Armour of Agathys</b> is a passive feature granted by the condition and spell of the same name.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>A spectral frost covers you and your gear. When a creature hits you with a melee attack, it takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">5 x spell level</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Necromite\" title=\"Necromite\">Necromite</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p><p>Granted by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Agathys_(Condition)\" title=\"Armour of Agathys (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Armour_of_Agathys_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Armour_of_Agathys_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Armour_of_Agathys_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Armour_of_Agathys_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Armour_of_Agathys_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Armour_of_Agathys_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour of Agathys\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Armour_of_Agathys_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Armour_of_Agathys_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Armour_of_Agathys_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Agathys_(Condition)\" title=\"Armour of Agathys (Condition)\">Armour of Agathys</a>.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203009\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 986/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7337/4194304 bytes\nTemplate 